§§ `Order 45 Rule 5 -- applications under section 10 or 16`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Rule 5(1): "An application under section 10 or 16 for the discharge or suspension of the writ of distress or for the release of any part of the property distrained must be made by summons within 14 days
-- of the seizure, supported by affidavit stating the grounds on which the application is made."
