    IF `the amount recoverable under the writ of distress has been realised by the sale of any of the movable property seized`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "As soon as the amount recoverable under the writ of distress has been realised by the sale of any of the movable property seized"

