GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 45 r 9 the officer in possession's duty to notify the Sheriff arises` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (NOT (`the property seized under an enforcement order is to be released`))
           THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the property seized under an enforcement order is to be released, the officer in possession under such enforcement order must, before giving up possession, notify the Sheriff of the officer's intention to do so" (the condition is not met)
           OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

